  "prefLabel": "Rev 1206.02 Penalties for Erroneously Paid Claims",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1206.02 Penalties for Erroneously Paid Claims. If a claimant receives an erroneously paid claim, the claimant shall be assessed for the amount of relief issued plus interest as provided under RSA 21-J:28 and an additional penalty of 25 percent of the erroneous amount of such claim.\n\nSource. #9946, eff 6-23-11; ss by #12923, eff 11-26-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1200.html"
}
